Cantoni commercial outbound is intentionally paused.

Do not remove this file or run outbound with OUTBOUND_FORCE_RUN=1 until all of these are true:
- `npm run audit:post-unblock-launch` has no blockers except the intentional outbound pause.
- `npm run audit:email-dns` returns ok=true for cantonidigitalstudio.com.
- `npm run test:social-public` returns ok=true for current official Cantoni public channels.
- `npm run test:lead-endpoint` returns ok=true before any public campaign or outreach run.
- `npm run test:outreach-readiness` returns ok=true before any real outbound run.
- The exact outbound batch has been reviewed and approved in chat.
- The visible sender/account is verified as cantonidigitalstudio@gmail.com.
- Any real send uses the explicit approval token required by scripts/day1_send_background.sh.

This flag does not block local lead research, draft generation, QA, or no-send review artifacts.
